<title>FRANCE: Essilor Int H1 sales up 22 percent.</title>
<headline>Essilor Int H1 sales up 22 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 4,577    vs    3,751</p>
<p>NOTE - Essilor said in a financial advertisement that exchange rate changes had a six percent positive contribution to sales.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
